      "Validation metrics: results/tables/baseline_results.csv\n",
      "Test metrics: results/tables/baseline_test_results.csv\n",
      "Dự báo gộp: results/baseline_predictions.csv\n",
      "Timestamp đánh giá: results/eval_timestamps.csv\n",
      "Top 10 sai số: results/tables/top10_worst_errors.csv\n",
